ions`, extend the pre-commit large-file exclude, document in `docs/local-dev-env.md`. depends_on: `fixed-spinulose-hoverfly`. No detail comment (the description carries everything).\n\nThe held-out epic `traitorous-official-sunbittern` (`6ed2-24e5-6985-4faa`) depends on this epic: its S1's `depends_on` link to S5 here was escalated to the epic-to-epic edge `6ed2-24e5-6985-4faa -> f400-65b3-1899-4af9`.\n\nArithmetic note for S2: the table (4) KEEP list enumerates 26 functions (25 + the rewritten 19) and the DELETE list 11, which sum to the module's 37; the story's counts are derived from those named lists rather than from the \"37 → 23\" summary line in section (4) above."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788808122800333316,"uuid":"1d1ad292-8314-459f-a427-385733df736f"}